        "## 4. Weak picks + leakage check\n",
        "\n",
        "*Which picks look wrong and why? Confirm no product flags or future windows leaked in.*\n",
        "## 4. Weak picks + leakage check\n",
        "\n",
        "## 4. Weak picks + leakage check\n",
        "\n",
        "The baseline is intentionally simple and produced a Precision@10 of approximately 0.60, compared with an overall observed decline base rate of approximately 0.54.\n",
        "\n",
        "This means some highly ranked pages were weak picks. High visibility and age do not guarantee decline or guarantee that a full refresh is the correct action.\n",
        "\n",
        "The rule ignores potentially important distinctions such as search intent, seasonality, ranking position, CTR opportunity, content accuracy, and whether the page recently received campaign traffic.\n",
        "\n",
        "These weaknesses give the Week 5 model a clear and honestly beatable baseline.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Leakage check\n",
        "\n",
        "The score uses only:\n",
        "\n",
        "* `days_since_last_update`\n",
        "* `impressions_90d`\n",
        "\n",
        "The following fields are not score inputs:\n",
        "\n",
        "* `trend_direction`\n",
        "* `trend_pct`\n",
        "* `is_declining_label`\n",
        "* `impressions_last_30d`\n",
        "* `impressions_prev_30d`\n",
        "* `clicks_last_30d`\n",
        "* `clicks_prev_30d`\n",
        "\n",
        "The label is used only after ranking to evaluate Precision@10. It is not included in the generated CSV.\n"
      ],
      "id": "f4AKh_bmeeh1"
    },
